@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Latitude invalide — HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 91,
  "longitude": 2.3522,
  "placeType": "PARK",
  "crowdLevel": 2
}

### 2. Affluence hors limites — HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 48.8566,
  "longitude": 2.3522,
  "placeType": "PARK",
  "crowdLevel": 6
}

### 3. Affluence non entière — HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 48.8566,
  "longitude": 2.3522,
  "placeType": "PARK",
  "crowdLevel": 2.5
}

### 4. Type de lieu inconnu — HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 48.8566,
  "longitude": 2.3522,
  "placeType": "UNKNOWN",
  "crowdLevel": 2
}

### 5. Champ obligatoire absent — HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 48.8566,
  "longitude": 2.3522,
  "placeType": "PARK"
}

### 6. Rayon trop grand — HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?latitude=48.8566&longitude=2.3522&radiusKm=101
Accept: application/json

### 7. Rayon nul — HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?latitude=48.8566&longitude=2.3522&radiusKm=0
Accept: application/json

### 8. Paramètre manquant — HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?latitude=48.8566&longitude=2.3522
Accept: application/json

### 9. Coordonnée non numérique — HTTP 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports?latitude=abc&longitude=2.3522&radiusKm=10
Accept: application/json
